# Navigation & Koin (Core)

New screens must be wired into both navigation and DI or the app will fail at runtime.

## Navigation Checklist

```kotlin
// 1. Route.kt
@Serializable
data class EditCategory(val id: Int) : Route

// 2. NavigationRoot.kt — NavDisplay → entryProvider
entry<EditCategory> { route ->
    EditCategoryScreen(categoryId = route.id)
}
```

Missing `entry<...>` → screen is unreachable.

## Koin Registration

```kotlin
// Feature Module.kt
val editCategoryModule = module {
    includes(domainCategoryModule)
    viewModelOf(::EditCategoryViewModel)
}

// Domain Module.kt
factoryOf(::GetCategoryUseCase)

// Root app module — MUST include new feature module
includes(editCategoryModule)
```

Register every new UseCase, Repository, DataSource, and ViewModel. Omitting registration → runtime crash on injection.
